From: Grant McNaught <1371263+gmcnaught@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 19:39:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 28/34] fix: DRAWCACHE stale-Z-order bug (Critical) + revert
 HASFIELDCACHE to opt-in (final review findings)

bring_to_front()/bring_to_back() mutate an entity's z via ZOrderInfo
(set_z), which DrawingOrderComparator sorts on for entities not drawn
in Y order -- but neither function marked entities_to_draw dirty.
With SOLARUS_DRAWCACHE now default-ON, a quest calling
entity:bring_to_front()/bring_to_back() in an otherwise-static scene
would keep the stale draw order indefinitely. Fixed: both functions
now set entities_to_draw_dirty = true.

SOLARUS_HASFIELDCACHE reverted to opt-in: userdata_has_field()'s
cache also covers userdata_has_metafield(), which reads the shared
per-type Lua metatable handed live to scripts by
sol.main.get_metatable() -- that table has no mutation-detection
hook, so a script adding a field to it after gameplay has already
cached a negative result for some instance goes undetected. Narrow
but real and undisclosed if defaulted on; same risk bucket as
SOLARUS_GROUNDCACHE, which was already kept opt-in for a comparable
reason.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0133rsEoHDDF8D9i1Fv51Tco
---
 src/entities/Entities.cpp |  6 ++++++
 src/lua/LuaContext.cpp    | 14 ++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/entities/Entities.cpp b/src/entities/Entities.cpp
index 9b9ede8..65d9092 100644
--- a/src/entities/Entities.cpp
+++ b/src/entities/Entities.cpp
@@ -631,6 +631,10 @@ void Entities::bring_to_front(Entity& entity) {
   const EntityPtr& shared_entity = std::static_pointer_cast<Entity>(entity.shared_from_this());
   int layer = entity.get_layer();
   z_orders.at(layer).bring_to_front(shared_entity);
+  // [SOLARUS_DRAWCACHE] Changes this entity's z, which DrawingOrderComparator
+  // sorts on for entities not drawn in Y order -- the cached entities_to_draw
+  // order would otherwise go stale (final whole-branch review finding).
+  entities_to_draw_dirty = true;
 }
 
 /**
@@ -642,6 +646,8 @@ void Entities::bring_to_back(Entity& entity) {
   const EntityPtr& shared_entity = std::static_pointer_cast<Entity>(entity.shared_from_this());
   int layer = entity.get_layer();
   z_orders.at(layer).bring_to_back(shared_entity);
+  // [SOLARUS_DRAWCACHE] See bring_to_front() above.
+  entities_to_draw_dirty = true;
 }
 
